uction--eu--public-documents/spl_1JW84N7721S0PCYD/prj_1KC8T0EGS1S0H36R/pjd_1KRV27JPK1S0HAZC/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"Project Design Document | 04 Feb 2026\"},{\"h\":\"/ghg-entry/rmv_1KNVPSX9T1S0B8B5?tab=calculation-view\",\"t\":\"See GHG entry →\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JW84N7721S0PCYD/prj_1KC8T0EGS1S0H36R/pjd_1KRV2KWWS1S0C9JB/ghg_statement.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JW84N7721S0PCYD/prj_1KC8T0EGS1S0H36R/pjd_1KRV2H4AC1S0RMPP/validation_%26_verification_report.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JW84N7721S0PCYD/prj_1KC8T0EGS1S0H36R/pjd_1KRV2FP8Z1S04ZV1/project_name_change_record.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JW84N7721S0PCYD/prj_1KC8T0EGS1S0H36R/pjd_1KK44ZHN51S0EXYJ/public_comment_summary.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JW84N7721S0PCYD/prj_1KC8T0EGS1S0H36R/pjd_1KRV27JPK1S0HAZC/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"VALIDATED\\nBICRS\\n200Y+\\nProject Agneerath\\nEarthrevive Technologies\\nISSUED\\n5.6\\nBUFFER POOL\\n0.112\\nCREDITING PERIOD\\n01 Jan 2026 to 01 Jan 2031\\nSummary\\nRemoval method\\nCalculation overview\\nFeedstocks\\nProject documentation\\nCertificates\\nReversal risk\\nSummary\\n\\nWe are developing a project with smallholder farmers of India to convert waste Agri residues and invasive species into Biochar and restore grasslands.\\n\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nCurrent verifier\\nCarbon Check\\n->\\nProject code\\nY76J\\nApproval date\\n17 May 2026\\nCurrent protocol version\\nBiochar Production and Storage v1.2\\nSUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT GOALS\\n⌘ + scroll to zoom\\nProject Agneerath\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nBiomass Carbon Removal and Storage (BiCRS) involves storing the carbon contained in waste biomass—organic material from living or recently living organisms. BiCRS works by halting or slowing the decomposition of biomass, enabling the carbon it contains to be stored long-term. This can be achieved by converting biomass into materials that decompose more slowly—such as biochar or bio-oil—or by storing it in environments where decomposition is slowed. For BiCRS to count as carbon removal, the biomass must be replenished to ensure additional carbon dioxide is drawn from the atmosphere.\\n\\nProject Design Document\\n04 Feb 2026\\nCalculation overview\\nCalculations demonstrating 5.60 tCO₂e removed from Project Agneerath on 01 Apr 2026\\nSee GHG entry →\\nNet CO₂e Removed\\n5.601 t\\nSequestrations\\n7.092 t\\n-\\nActivities\\n1.492 tCO₂e\\n⌘ + scroll to zoom\\nView full screen\\nFeedstocks\\n\\nFeedstocks are the validated input materials that have been used for this project.\\n\\nName\\tCategory\\tValidated\\nCotton Stalk\\tBiomass\\t04 Jun 2026\\nShowing 1 of 1\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n17 May 2026\\tGHG Statement\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n17 May 2026\\tValidation & Verification Report\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n17 May 2026\\tProject Name Change Record\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n07 Mar 2026\\tPublic Comment Summary\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n04 Feb 2026\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 5 of 5\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nCertificates\\nIssued\\n5.6\\nRetired\\n0\\nBuffer pool\\n0.112\\nCrediting period\\n01 Jan 2026 to 01 Jan 2031\\nIssuances\\nRetirements\\nIssue date\\tIssued\\tBuffer pool\\tSupplier allocation\\n17 May 2026\\t5.6\\t0.112\\t5.488\\nShowing 1 of 1\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nReversal risk\\n\\nThe risk of reversal for this project has been assessed as very low. This means that 2% of certificates issued for this project are allocated to Earthrevive Technologies's buffer pool.\\n\\nTo date, this project has contributed 0.112 certificates to the buffer pool which holds a total of 0.112 certificates.\\n\\nEarthrevive Technologies has no reversals to date.\\n\\nLearn more about reversal risk\"}"